  "单目标90°平滑跟枪": "Single target 90 degrees smooth. Gun.",
  "提升平滑度，目标会在正前方90°范围内来回平移，在训练过程中帮助你找到适合自己的发力方式以及手腕和手臂的发力配合，低敏需要复位，目标较小，需要一定耐心。": "Raises the smoothness, the target moves back and forth within 90 degrees in the straight front, helps you to find a way to work for yourself and to work with your wrists and arms in the course of training. Insensitive needs to be repositioned, smaller targets need to be patient.",
