  "这个模板既没有「穿越」也没有「摆射」行为，调度器会跳过它。": "The template is neither \"cross\" nor \"show\" and the dispatcher will skip it.",
  "把几条穿越路线（或摆射点）交给它统一放人。它不占位置：穿越的敌人从路线自己的起点出来，摆射点的敌人出现在这条路线上摆的点（地图上的菱形，能拖能转）；地图上只是把调度器画在这些点的上空。": "Give it several passage routes (or point-of-shows) for a single release. It is unpositioned: the enemy that crosses comes from its own point of departure, and the enemy of the point of launch appears at the point on the route (the diamond shape on the map can be pulled and turned); it simply paints the dispatcher over these points.",
  "还挂在生成器": "Still hanging on the generator.",
  "个、而且都下场之后，这个调度器就停了；场上没有别的目标时这一局提前结算。": "After all, the dispatcher stopped; when there were no other targets on the scene, the bureau settled in advance.",
