  "有敌人会复活或不限量，这一局只能等到时间到。名场面要每个敌人只出场一次：穿越关掉「是否复活」， 重生的「击杀后」选「不复活」，调度器把「出场总数」设成有限。": "An enemy will be resurrected or limited in number, and this will only wait until the time has come. Every enemy must appear only once: through the closure of the \"renewal\" and the reborn \"renewed\" \"renewal\" option, the dispatcher sets the \"total out\" to a limited extent.",
