  "（在左栏顶上换）。 地图的几何与碰撞都来自游戏文件。场景里原有的方块会叠加在地图之上，不会被替换。 想取某个位置的坐标：在左栏选「玩家出生点」，把手柄拖到那里，坐标就显示在下面。": "(Turn on top of left). The geometry and collisions of the map are from the game files. The original squares in the scene will be superimposed on the map and will not be replaced. If you want to take the coordinates of a certain position, select the \"player birthplace\" in the left field and drag the handle there, the coordinates are shown below.",
