  "把这份场景发布到玩家创意工坊，审核通过后所有人都能玩": "Let's get this out to the player's creative workshop, and everyone can play it after the review.",
  "1.3 作品：你通过瓦创意工坊制作并提交到玩家创意工坊的训练场景，包括场景文件（敌人、路线、出场、计分等设置）、标题、描述、封面截图，以及你之后提交的每一个更新版本。": "1.3 Works: You produce and submit to the player ' s creative workshop training scenes, including the scene document (enemy, route, field, score setting), title, description, cover screen, and every subsequent updated version.",
  "3.8 我们作为权利人，可以自行决定对抄袭、搬运、倒卖作品的行为采取维权措施。需要时，你应配合提供创作过程的记录（例如场景的各个版本、截图）。": "3.8 As rights holders, we may take measures to defend ourselves against the practice of copying, moving or selling works. If necessary, you should cooperate with a record of the creation process (e.g., versions of the scene, screenshots).",
  "6.3 作品的标题、描述和场景中出现的文字，不含违法违规、低俗、辱骂的内容，不含广告、联系方式、群号、网址或二维码。": "6.3 The title, description and text appearing in the scene of the work does not contain any unlawful, vulgar or abusive content, nor advertising, contact details, group numbers, web sites or 2D codes.",
