  "网页练枪": "Web site gun practice",
  "瞄准专家是爱收徒出品的无畏契约（瓦罗兰特）瞄准训练，浏览器打开就能练。瓦工坊在游戏地图里练实战枪法、挑战职业比赛名场面，还有玩家创意工坊和瓦创意工坊自建场景，另有 Windows 桌面版。": "The Wigand Industries practiced combat guns in game maps, challenged the professional competition, built their own scenes in the Players' Creative Industries and Wa Creative Industries, and also had Windows desktops.",
