  "挑战职业比赛名场面": "Challenge the career competition.",
  "还有玩家创意工坊和瓦创意工坊自建场景": "And the players' creative workshops and the Wa creative workshops built their own scenes.",
  "瓦创意工坊：自己搭无畏契约训练场景。选一张地图，把敌人摆到想练的位置，画好走位路线、定好时长和枪，搭完一个分享码就能发给朋友，打开就是你摆的样子。需要用电脑打开。": "Wigand Creative Industries: You're a fearless training ground. Pick a map, put the enemy in a position where you want to practice, draw a walk, set a time and a gun, and give it to your friends after a share code. Open it. You need to use a computer to open it.",
