  "画出当时手上那把枪与自己的手（模型、持枪姿势、后坐踢动全部来自游戏本体）。**纯视觉**：不参与任何判定，开关它不影响成绩、漂移检测与「已校验」那一列。默认关是因为它会占掉右下角约两成画面；想看后坐把枪口顶到哪、连发时枪怎么越抬越高，就打开它。模型的视野档位跟着显示设置里的「模型视野」走。第一次打开要下约 1.35 MB 资产，资产取不到时就只是不画（不会有报错）。": "Draws the gun on hand and his hand (models, gun positions, back-sit kicks all from the game body).** Pure vision**: without any decision, the switch does not affect achievement, drift detection and \"valid\" columns. The default is because it will take about two percent of the lower right corner; the door is open when you want to see where the gun is on the back, and how the gun is raised when you fire it. The view slot of the model follows the \"model vision\" in the set. The first time you open an estimated 1.35 MB asset, and if you fail to take it, you simply do not draw it (it will not be wrong).",
