  "新手第一个练哪个特工？哪个最好上手？": "Which agent was the first to train? Which one was the best?",
  "新手第一个练哪个特工": "Who's the first agent new guy to practice?",
  "哪个最好上手": "Which one's the best?",
  "新手别贪多，先固定 1 个好上手的练熟：① 想学枪战手感就玩「不死鸟(Phoenix)」——自带闪光+回血，试错成本低；② 更推荐先玩「奶妈(Sage)」这类哨卫——有墙有奶有复活，站桩守点对枪压力小，还特别容易被队友需要、上分快。先用一个英雄打满 20 把、把技能用成肌肉记忆，比每把换人强得多。想练谁问我，我给你调出对应的教学。": "First, if you want to learn how to shoot, play Phoenix — with a self-blowing flash + blood, and at a low cost; and second, you're going to have to play a guard like Sage — with a wall and milk and a rejuvenated gun, with a stand-up under pressure, and especially easy to get a teammate to use. First, you can use a hero to fill 20 with a muscle memory, and use your skills to remember more than every change. You want to practice someone, I'll get you a corresponding lesson.",
  "新手别贪多": "Don't be greedy.",
  "先固定": "Hold it.",
  "个好上手的练熟": "A good, good, good, good, good, good.",
  "想学枪战手感就玩": "You want to play with the gunfighter?",
  "自带闪光": "Autolight",
  "回血": "Blood.",
  "试错成本低": "Low test error cost",
  "更推荐先玩": "I'd rather play first.",
  "奶妈": "Nurse.",
  "这类哨卫": "Such a guard.",
  "有墙有奶有复活": "There's walls and milk and there's a resurrection.",
  "站桩守点对枪压力小": "Stand guard, light pressure on the gun.",
  "还特别容易被队友需要": "They're particularly vulnerable to the team.",
  "上分快": "Top score.",
  "先用一个英雄打满": "First, we'll fill it with a hero.",
  "把技能用成肌肉记忆": "Use your skills as a muscle memory.",
  "比每把换人强得多": "It's better than every change.",
  "想练谁问我": "Who's gonna ask me?",
  "我给你调出对应的教学": "I'll get you the right teaching.",
  "点位教学": "Pointing teaching",
  "地图点位记不住，进攻烟 / 闪光该扔哪？": "- I can't remember the map. - Where to throw the flash?",
  "地图点位记不住": "I can't remember the map.",
  "进攻烟": "Attack smoke.",
  "闪光该扔哪": "Where to throw the flash?",
  "别一上来背全图，先记「每张图 A/B 点各 1 个必封烟位」：进攻时烟要封住对手架枪的第一个视野角，闪光往你要进的那个门/角上方抛、队友贴着闪进。练法：自定义房打开「显示弹道」，把你常去那张图的 2-3 个核心烟位扔到形成肌肉记忆。告诉我具体哪张图哪个点，我直接给你标好点位、还附出自哪个视频第几分钟。": "And don't come up with a whole picture, remember, \"One smoke-free spot for each A/B point\": The smoke should seal the first view angle of the gun, and flash to the door/angle you want to enter, and the teammates will stick it in. Practice: Open the \"Show the ballistics\" in the custom room and throw you to muscle memory at the two or three core smoke spots that you often go to. Tell me which one of the points is, I will mark you directly and attach you to the first minute of the video.",
  "别一上来背全图": "Don't come up with a whole picture.",
  "先记": "Remember",
  "每张图": "Every graph",
  "点各": "I'll make the difference.",
  "个必封烟位": "A smoke table.",
  "进攻时烟要封住对手架枪的第一个视野角": "The smoke should seal the first angle of the gun when the attack is made.",
  "闪光往你要进的那个门": "# Shine to the door you're going to enter #",
  "角上方抛": "Up the corner.",
  "队友贴着闪进": "Teammates, get in here.",
  "练法": "Practice",
  "自定义房打开": "Custom Room Open",
  "显示弹道": "Show ballistics",
  "把你常去那张图的": "I'm the one who used to take you to that picture.",
  "个核心烟位扔到形成肌肉记忆": "A core cigarette spot is thrown into muscle memory.",
  "告诉我具体哪张图哪个点": "Tell me exactly which one of these is which one.",
  "我直接给你标好点位": "I'll just point you right at the point.",
  "还附出自哪个视频第几分钟": "And the video from which minute?",
  "为什么我总是对枪输？压枪压不住怎么练？": "Why do I always lose to a gun? How can I practice when I can't hold a gun?",
  "压枪压不住怎么练": "How can you practice when you can't hold a gun?",
  "对枪输大多不是手慢：① 别站着拼枪——先横向急停再开第一枪，拉开身位让他打空；② 压枪不是一路往下拉，是「前几发轻压、之后跟着弹道走」，幽灵和暴徒弹道不同要分开练；③ 每次射击后把准星拉回头线高度。今晚靶场 10 分钟：急停单点 + 暴徒压第一梭子，再打一把死斗强迫自己「先动再开枪」。": "Most of the shooting was not slow: one, stop standing -- first, stop horizontally and then pull the first shot, and let him empty; two, not pull the gun down, \"first light, then follow the ballistics\" -- and the ghost and the mob have to work separately; three, after each shot, pull the star back to the line. Tonight's range 10 minutes: stop at the single point + the mob presses the first shuttle, then fights with a death to force itself to \"act and shoot.\"",
  "对枪输大多不是手慢": "Most of the guns aren't slow.",
  "别站着拼枪": "Don't stand and fight.",
  "先横向急停再开第一枪": "First, you stop the cross-section and then you shoot first.",
  "拉开身位让他打空": "Pulling up his position and making him empty.",
  "压枪不是一路往下拉": "The gun is not going down the way.",
  "前几发轻压": "A few light-pressures.",
  "之后跟着弹道走": "Then follow the ballistics.",
  "幽灵和暴徒弹道不同要分开练": "The ghost and the mob have to work apart.",
  "每次射击后把准星拉回头线高度": "After each shot, pull the star back at the height of the line.",
  "今晚靶场": "Tonight's range.",
  "急停单点": "Stop it!",
  "暴徒压第一梭子": "The mob's on the first.",
  "再打一把死斗强迫自己": "One more fight to force yourself.",
  "先动再开枪": "Move and shoot.",
