  "至少 2 个：第一个是出现点（绿），最后一个是消失点（红）；中间的用来绕拐角。地图上直接拖标记就能排，松手自动贴地。每个路点上的「停留」是走到那儿站多久再走（0 = 不停；站着的时候照样能打）；「到下一个点」是那一段的速度，不填就跟下面的「移动速度」": "At least two: the first is the emergence point (green), the last is the disappearance point (red); the middle is used to round the corner. The direct drag marks on the map can line up and release the hand automatically. The \"stop\" on each point is how long it goes to stand there (0 = constant; can be played while standing); the \"to the next point\" is the speed, or \"move\" below.",
