  "**重要提示：** 本协议由你与上海爱收徒游戏有限公司（以下称「我们」）订立，是《用户服务协议》的组成部分。请你仔细阅读全部条款，**特别是加粗的条款：作品著作财产权的无偿转让与保底授权、我们对作品的修改（第三条），下架与官方重新上架（第四条），违规责任（第七条）**。未满 18 周岁的，请在监护人陪同下阅读，并取得监护人同意后再发布作品。你勾选同意并提交作品，即表示你已阅读、理解并同意本协议的全部内容。": "** Important tip:** This agreement was concluded between you and Shanghai Aee-Wan Game Ltd. (hereinafter \"we\") and is part of the User Service Agreement.** Please read carefully the entire article,** especially the coarse one: the pro bono transfer and warranty of the property right to work, our amendment of the work (art. 3), our re-upgrading of the next shelf and the official one (art. 4), and liability for non-compliance (art. 7).** If you are under 18, read it with the guardian and obtain the guardian's consent.",
