  "同意后": "With your consent.",
  "本协议在你和我们之间成立": "This agreement is between you and us.",
  "2.2 此后你每次提交投稿，提交页面会写明该作品的名称。你点击提交，即确认该作品适用本协议。我们会记录作品名称、投稿编号、提交时间和当时适用的协议版本。**该记录与本协议共同构成你与我们之间关于该作品的书面转让合同。**": "2.2 Each subsequent submission of a contribution will include the name of the work. Click to confirm that the work is covered by this agreement. We will record the name of the work, the number of the contribution, the time of submission and the version of the agreement then applicable.** Together with this agreement, the record constitutes the written contract of transfer of the work between you and us.**",
