  "该记录与本协议共同构成你与我们之间关于该作品的书面转让合同": "The record together with this agreement constitutes a written contract of transfer between you and us for the work.",
  "第三条 作品的权利归属": "Article 3 - Right to work",
  "作品的权利归属": "The right to work",
  "3.1 **你提交的作品审核通过并在玩家创意工坊公开时，你对作品中由你创作的部分享有的著作权中的全部财产权利，转让给我们。** 包括《中华人民共和国著作权法》第十条第一款第（五）项至第（十七）项规定的复制权、发行权、出租权、展览权、表演权、放映权、广播权、信息网络传播权、摄制权、改编权、翻译权、汇编权，以及应当由著作权人享有的其他财产权利。**转让的地域范围为全世界，期限为上述权利的整个保护期。**": "3.1 ** The review of the works submitted by you was approved and, when the player's creative workshops were made public, you transferred to us all the property rights in the authorship rights of the parts of the works you created.** The geographical scope of the transfer is the entire world, for the entire period of protection of the above-mentioned rights, as provided for in article 10, paragraph 1 (e) to (vii), of the Copyright Law of the People's Republic of China, the right to reproduction, the right to issue, the right to rent, the right to exhibit, the right to show, the right to broadcast, the right to disseminate information networks, the right to film, the right to adapt, the right to translate, the right to compile and the right to other property rights that should be enjoyed by the author.** The geographical scope of the transfer is the world as a whole, and the duration of the protection of the above-mentioned rights is the entire period.**",
  "你提交的作品审核通过并在玩家创意工坊公开时": "You're submitting a review of your work and you're making it public at the Player Creative Industries.",
  "你对作品中由你创作的部分享有的著作权中的全部财产权利": "You have all the property rights in your work that you have in your work.",
  "转让给我们": "Transfer to us.",
  "包括": "Including",
  "中华人民共和国著作权法": "Copyright Law of the People ' s Republic of China",
  "第十条第一款第": "Article 10, paragraph 1 (a)",
  "项至第": "to",
  "十七": "XVII",
  "项规定的复制权": "Right to reproduction under the provision",
