  "转让的地域范围为全世界": "The geographical area of transfer is the world",
  "期限为上述权利的整个保护期": "The duration of the protection of the above-mentioned rights is the entire period of protection",
  "3.2 **上述转让是无偿的，转让价金为人民币零元。** 我们为作品提供存储、审核、展示和推广服务，不向你收取任何费用。为鼓励创作，我们会对作品给予以下奖励：作品公开后游玩次数超过 1,000 次的，奖励积分（积分功能上线后发放，发放数量与积分的用途以届时公布的规则为准）；我们评选出的优秀作品，授予开发者徽章，或赠送游戏外设等奖品。游玩次数以我们的统计为准；通过刷游玩次数等不正当方式取得的奖励，我们可以不予发放或者收回。上述奖励以及我们给予你的推荐，不是作品转让的价金，不改变本条约定。": "3.2 ** The above-mentioned transfers are free of charge and the transfer price is RM$0.** We provide storage, auditing, display and promotion services for the works, without charge to you. To encourage creativity, we give the following incentives: the award of points after the open and after the opening of the work more than 1,000 times, which are distributed (after the credit is online, the amount is given and the use of the points is subject to the rules published at that time); the well-qualified work we evaluate, the developer’s badge or the prize given outside the game. The number of tours is based on our statistics; the award obtained in an improper manner, such as the number of brushing, can be withheld or withdrawn.",
