  "3.3 作品审核期间，以及作品被驳回、被你撤回时，作品的著作权仍归你所有。你同意我们为审核、留存记录和处理投诉的目的，存储、复制、试玩作品，并向审核人员展示。": "3.3 You will retain the copyright of the work during the examination of the work and when it is rejected and withdrawn. You agree that we store, copy, test and present the work to the examiner for the purposes of the review, record-keeping and handling of the complaint.",
