  "3.4 作品的署名权、修改权、保护作品完整权等人身权利依法属于你。我们在玩家创意工坊、作品分享页和对外展示中保留你的署名。**我们以官方名义重新上架的作品（见第四条），标注为「官方所有」，并以「原作者」的方式保留你的署名；你可以要求不署名，届时显示为「原作者匿名」。**": "3.4 The personal rights to sign, modify and protect the integrity of a work belong to you. We keep your signature in the player ' s creative workshops, on the work sharing page and in the external exhibition.** The work we have re-listed in the official name (see article 4) is labelled as \"official ownership\" and your signature is retained in the form of \"original author \" . You may request that it be withheld and displayed as \"anonymity of the original author \" .**",
