  "届时显示为": "Show as",
  "3.5 **你同意并授权我们（包括我们的审核人员）为审核、适配版本更新、修复问题、调整难度与分类、生成封面与预览、翻译等目的修改作品；以官方名义重新上架的作品，我们还可以继续维护、更新和改编。** 我们不会以歪曲、篡改的方式使用作品。": "3.5 ** You agree with and authorize us (including our reviewers) to modify the work for the purposes of review, adaptation, updating, repairing, adjustment of difficulty and classification, production of cover and preview, translation, etc.; work re-emergence in the official name, which we can continue to maintain, update and adapt.** We will not use in a distorted or altered manner.",
