  "3.7 转让后，我们免费授予你以下使用许可：你可以在瓦创意工坊中继续打开、修改该作品，并按本协议提交更新（我们以官方名义重新上架的作品除外）；你可以在个人社交账号上分享作品的截图、录像和分享链接。**除此之外，你不得将作品或其修改版本发布到其他平台、出售，或授权他人使用。**": "3.7 After the transfer, you are granted the following licence free of charge: you can continue to open, modify and update the work in the Wa Creative Industries, except for the work we have re-mounted in the official name, and you can share the screenshot, video and links on the personal social account.** Except for this, you may not publish the work or its modified version on other platforms, sell it or authorize others to use it.**",
