  "3.9 **如果第 3.1 条约定的转让因任何原因被认定无效、被撤销或者不能履行，视为你自作品公开时起，授予我们对作品中由你创作的部分享有的全部著作财产权利的专有使用权（独占许可）：地域范围为全世界，期限为整个著作权保护期，不可撤销，免费，可以转授权给我们的关联公司和合作方；我们可以以自己的名义对侵权行为维权。本协议其他条款（包括第四条关于重新上架的约定）照常适用。** 本款的效力独立于第 3.1 条。": "3.9 ** If a treaty transfer is declared invalid, revoked or unperformed for any reason, it is considered that you have, since the publication of the work, granted us exclusive use of the property rights (separate authorization) to all works of which you have created: a worldwide, full copyright protection period, irrevocable, free of charge, and a transfer of authority to our affiliated companies and cooperating parties; we can defend rights in our own name in respect of torts. Other provisions of this Agreement (including article IV agreement on re-emergation) apply as usual.** The effect of this paragraph is independent of article 3.1.",
