  "4.3 **作品公开后，你可以在「我的投稿」中申请下架自己的作品，并写明理由。我们的审核人员同意后，作品暂停展示，游玩次数和收藏会保留；不同意的，作品继续展示，我们会告诉你原因。下架是我们为你提供的管理功能，不收回第三条约定的权利：作品的著作财产权仍归我们，我们可以决定以官方名义重新上架。**": "4.3 ** After the publication of the work, you can apply for the next set of your work in my contribution, with reasons. With the approval of our examiner, the display is suspended, the number of play and the collection will be kept; if you do not agree, the work continues to be displayed, we will tell you why. The next shelf is the management function we provide you, and we do not take back the right agreed in article 3: the property right to the work remains with us, and we can decide to re-take it in the official name.**",
