  "4.4 **我们以官方名义重新上架的作品，标注为「官方所有」，并按第 3.4 条保留你的原作者署名，我们会通知你。重新上架后，作品由我们管理，你不能再下架、更新或删除它。** 你希望恢复对作品的管理的，可以联系我们，由我们决定。": "4.4 ** The work we have re-listed in the official name, labelled as “officially owned”, and the signature of your original author is retained in accordance with Article 3.4, we will inform you. Once you have re-listed, the work is under our management, and you cannot re-establish, update or delete it.** If you wish to resume the management of the work, you can contact us and we can decide.",
