  "11.1 本协议适用中华人民共和国大陆地区法律。双方发生争议的，应友好协商；协商不成的，任何一方可以向上海爱收徒游戏有限公司所在地有管辖权的人民法院提起诉讼。": "11.1 This Agreement shall apply the laws of the Mainland Region of the People's Republic of China. In case of dispute between the Parties, friendly consultations shall be held; in case of failure of such negotiations, either Party may bring a case before the People's Court of Justice, which has jurisdiction over the seat of the Shanghai Ae-Leaves Games Ltd.",
