  "12.1 本协议是《用户服务协议》的组成部分。关于作品的权利义务，本协议与《用户服务协议》不一致的，以本协议为准。": "12.1 This Agreement is an integral part of the User Service Agreement. In respect of the rights and obligations in respect of works of work, this Agreement shall prevail if it is inconsistent with the User Service Agreement.",
