  "作品要是你自己做的，不能带广告和联系方式；未满 18 岁请先取得监护人同意。审核时和公开以后，平台都可以帮你修问题、调参数和难度；公开后被平台直接改过的作品，署名写成「你、官方」，你要先换成平台改过的那一版才能接着更新。详见下面的全文。": "If you do it yourself, you cannot have advertising or contact information; you can have your guardian's consent before you reach the age of 18. The platform can fix your problems, adjust your parameters and difficulties when you're 18; the work that you have been directly modified by the platform after being made public, under the signature of \"You, Official\", you have to change to the version that you have changed to the platform before you can update it.",
