  "署名写成": "Signed",
  "你要先换成平台改过的那一版才能接着更新": "You have to change to the version you changed to be the one you're going to update.",
  "**重要提示：** 本协议由你与上海爱收徒游戏有限公司（以下称「我们」）订立，是《用户服务协议》的组成部分。请你仔细阅读全部条款，**特别是加粗的条款：作品著作财产权的无偿转让与保底授权、我们对作品的修改与「官方」署名（第三条），下架与官方重新上架（第四条），违规责任（第七条）**。未满 18 周岁的，请在监护人陪同下阅读，并取得监护人同意后再发布作品。你勾选同意并提交作品，即表示你已阅读、理解并同意本协议的全部内容。": "** Important tip:** This agreement was concluded between you and Shanghai Aee-Wan Game Ltd. (hereinafter \"we\") and forms part of the User Service Agreement.** Please read carefully the entire article,** especially the crude one: the pro bono transfer and warranting of property rights in works of work, our modification and the \"official\" signature (art. 3), the re-arrangement of the work and the re-arrangement of the next shelf with the official (art. 7)**. If you are under 18, please read it with the guardian's permission and publish it after you have obtained the guardian's consent.",
  "我们对作品的修改与": "We're changing the work and...",
  "署名": "Signature",
  "3.4 作品的署名权、修改权、保护作品完整权等人身权利依法属于你。我们在玩家创意工坊、作品分享页和对外展示中保留你的署名。**你同意我们按第 3.5 条的目的和范围修改作品，这样的修改不构成对你修改权、保护作品完整权的侵犯。作品公开后经我们直接修改的，署名为「你的署名、官方」，表示作品由你创作、经我们修改；作品仍由你管理，你可以按第 3.7 条继续更新它。我们以官方名义重新上架的作品（见第四条），标注为「官方所有」，并以「原作者」的方式保留你的署名；你可以要求不署名，届时显示为「原作者匿名」。**": "3.4 The personal rights to sign, amend, and protect the integrity of a work belong to you. We retain your signature in the player ' s creative workshops, the sharing page and the external exhibition.** You agree that we amend the work in accordance with the purpose and scope of Article 3.5, and that such a change does not constitute an infringement of your right to modify and protect the integrity of the work. The work, which we have directly amended, is published as \"your signature, official \" , indicating that the work is created by you and modified by us. The work remains under your administration and you can continue to update it in accordance with Article 3.7. The work that we re-carried in the official name (see Article 4) is marked as \"officially owned\" and that you retain your signature in the form of \"original author\" ; you may request that it be withheld and shown as \"unnamed by the original author\"**",
  "你同意我们按第": "You agree that we should",
