  "条继续更新它": "Keep it up.",
  "3.5 **你同意并授权我们（包括我们的审核人员和管理人员）为审核、适配版本更新、修复问题、调整参数（例如时长、敌人数量、武器、出场与路线）、调整难度与分类、生成封面与预览、翻译等目的修改作品；作品公开后，我们也可以直接修改并替换线上的版本，修改后会通知你。以官方名义重新上架的作品，我们还可以继续维护、更新和改编。** 我们不会以歪曲、篡改的方式使用作品。": "3.5 ** You agree with and authorize us (including our auditors and managers) to modify the works for the purposes of review, adaptation, updating, repairing, adjusting parameters (e.g., length of time, number of enemies, weapons, fielding and route), adjustment of difficulty and classification, generation of cover and preview, translation, etc. Once the work is made public, we can also modify and replace the version on the line and inform you of it. The work that has been re-listed in the official name can be continued, updated and adapted.** We will not use it in a distorted or altered manner.",
