  "3.7 转让后，我们免费授予你以下使用许可：你可以在瓦创意工坊中继续打开、修改该作品，并按本协议提交更新（我们以官方名义重新上架的作品除外）；你可以在个人社交账号上分享作品的截图、录像和分享链接。**作品经我们直接修改后，你需要先在瓦创意工坊中换成我们修改后的版本，在此基础上修改并提交更新；你在修改之前的版本上提交、尚未审核的更新，我们会撤回。除此之外，你不得将作品或其修改版本发布到其他平台、出售，或授权他人使用。**": "3.7 After the transfer, you are granted the following licence: you can continue to open, modify and update the work in the Wa Creative Industries, as provided for in this agreement (except for the work we have re-mounted in the official name); you can share the cut-off, video and link to the work on the personal social account.** After we have changed the work, you need to change it to the modified version of the Wa Creative Industries and submit it for updating; updates that you submitted on the previous version, which have not been reviewed, will be withdrawn.",
